## 🎯 What This Does

| Task | Description | Target |
|---|---|---|
| Regression | Predict next-day log return | `Target_Return` |
| Classification | Predict next-day direction (Up/Down) | `Target_Dir` |

**Primary model:** XGBoost with 125 engineered features across 7 groups
**Benchmark:** Buy-and-Hold (NIFTY 50)

