## 📊 Features Engineered (125 total)

| Group | Features | Count |
|---|---|---|
| Trend | SMA/EMA (5 windows), MACD, Golden Cross | ~25 |
| Momentum | RSI (×3), Stochastic, ROC (×3), Williams %R | ~15 |
| Volatility | Bollinger Bands, ATR, Keltner, Rolling Vol | ~20 |
| Volume | OBV, VWAP, MFI, Volume Ratio, Surge Flag | ~8 |
| Lag Features | Close/Return/Volume × 5 lags | ~25 |
| Rolling Stats | Mean, Std, Skew, Kurt, Range, Close Rank | ~20 |
| Calendar | Day, Month, Quarter, Budget Month (India) | ~8 |

**Zero lookahead bias** — all features use only past data, verified by unit tests.

---

## 🧪 Testing

```bash
pytest tests/ -v
# 80+ tests across data pipeline, features, models, evaluation, backtest
```

Key tests include:
- **Anti-lookahead test**: corrupts future data, checks past features are unaffected
- **Target leakage test**: ensures target columns never appear in feature set
- **Temporal split test**: verifies no overlap between train/val/test
- **Backtest logic test**: zero-cost always-long exactly matches Buy-and-Hold

